  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together jerk seasoning, soy sauce, lime juice, honey, crushed red pepper, allspice, and garlic.",
    "Add the chicken to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
